OL,3,GNEWSASchool could close as part of
OL,4,Atwo-tier switch plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is proposing major changes to
OL,7,Fschools as it moves towards a two-tier
OL,8,Feducation system.
OL,10,FThe plans would affect 21 schools in
OL,11,FCentral Bedfordshire - including in
OL,12,FAmpthill, Flitwick and Barton-le-Clay -
OL,13,Fand Sundon Lower School could close.
OL,15,FThe independently run authority said
OL,16,Fthe transformation would require about
OL,17,F#100m in capital investment, but that
OL,18,Fit needed government support as it did
OL,19,Fnot have all the funding for the
OL,20,Fscheme.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
