OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASchool could close as part of
OL,4,Atwo-tier switch plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FGareth Mackey, executive member for
OL,7,Fchildren and families, said: "No
OL,8,Fdecision has been made to implement
OL,9,Fthese changes and this is a very early
OL,10,Fstage in a long process. Any decision
OL,11,Fwould depend on securing necessary
OL,12,Ffunding and further consultation."
